  "description": "B-roll of the U.S Air Force Pararescue Jumpers from the Air Force Special Operations Command working with Virginia Task Force-One of the Fairfax County Urban Search and Rescue, to perform search and rescue operations within the Port au Prince area for Haiti Relief during Operating Unified Response. Scenes include both teams departing to a collapsed apartment building, in search of any survivors, Fairfax County work dogs searching through the rubble. Produced by Staff Sgt. Burt Traynor.",
